                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "88fee457-7b77-3e8e-b5f0-d03c4f661d4a",
                        "entry_id": "bb741dc4-801d-3e8d-b4da-bc5b25556617",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Wrapped or wound tightly with a second length of yarn or wire in a tight spiral, often by means of a gimping machine, leaving the core yarn straight and protected (gimped yarn). Also, generally, wrapped or twisted with string or wire (gimped buttons)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26eac481-5a60-3a9a-bd42-b806a145f48a",
                        "entry_id": "bb741dc4-801d-3e8d-b4da-bc5b25556617",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Adorned with gimp (decorative trim); edged or embroidered."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of fabric"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7aea6cfd-a967-3b0c-93e2-21a7c0f4ad14",
                        "entry_id": "bb741dc4-801d-3e8d-b4da-bc5b25556617",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Jagged, as a jagged or uneven edge or outline; notched, edged with serrations or grooves; nicked, dented."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "19d35f33-40b5-44d6-85d0-4c03ea84c9c0",
                                "sense_id": "7aea6cfd-a967-3b0c-93e2-21a7c0f4ad14",
                                "text": "The leaves... are slightly “gimped,” and this gives them an apparently wavy outline."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0bdb262e-ce4f-3e69-ae63-3fc9cce24588",
                        "entry_id": "bb741dc4-801d-3e8d-b4da-bc5b25556617",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Crippled, injured; damaged as to awkwardly impede function."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0c75a10-0e43-493b-894e-4c1daf7aef5c",
                                "sense_id": "0bdb262e-ce4f-3e69-ae63-3fc9cce24588",
                                "text": "Then he wheeled him around and began pushing him lickety-split down the hall, the chair's rickety wheels squealing like a gimped grocery cart."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "34e95e19-ea93-316e-a8c8-86f4b743a48f",
                        "entry_id": "bb741dc4-801d-3e8d-b4da-bc5b25556617",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Modified by means of the GIMP image editor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
